      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel desperate to hold onto your sense of self when you feel these cognitive slips happening. The intense fear you are describing sounds incredibly overwhelming, and it's important to treat this fear itself. Please reach out immediately to a crisis hotline or mental health professional to talk through these intense feelings of erasure and distress. You do not have to go through this terrifying feeling alone.",
      "source": "target",
